.TH "HED-MAIL" "1" "2026-08-22" "hed v1.21.2" "hed manual"
.SH NAME
hed\-mail \- A notmuch\-backed mail reader for hed.
Sync with mbsync, index with notmuch, browse threads in a list buffer,
read messages in a clean rendered view, reply / forward / send via msmtp
(or any sendmail\- compatible binary that reads RFC 822 on stdin).
.PP
A notmuch\-backed mail reader for hed.
Sync with \f[CR]mbsync\f[R], index with \f[CR]notmuch\f[R], browse
threads in a list buffer, read messages in a clean rendered view, reply
/ forward / send via \f[CR]msmtp\f[R] (or any sendmail\- compatible
binary that reads RFC 822 on stdin).
.SH Requirements
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]notmuch\f[R] \[em] search, tagging, message extraction
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]mbsync\f[R] (optional) \[em] \f[CR]:mail\-sync\f[R]
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]msmtp\f[R] or compatible (optional) \[em] \f[CR]:mail\-send\f[R]
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]w3m\f[R] or \f[CR]lynx\f[R] (optional) \[em] HTML\-only message
rendering
