.PP
\f[CR]mail://thread:\&...\f[R] names are also openable from outside the
plugin: the open\-intercept hook routes
\f[CR]:e mail://thread:\&...\f[R] and \f[CR]gf\f[R] on such a target
(e.g.\ in a markdown link captured with the tasks plugin\[cq]s
\f[CR]:task_capture\f[R]) to the thread view, whether or not the thread
is in the current listing.
\f[CR]mailto:\f[R] URIs route to compose the same way.
